# Data Dictionary – Games Weapon Balancing

## Dataset Overview
Contains information on 1,000 unique weapons, including fantasy and modern types. Suitable for game design, simulations, and data analysis projects.

## Key Columns

| Column        | Description                                                                   |
|---------------|-------------------------------------------------------------------------------|
| WeaponID      | Unique identifier for each weapon                                             |
| WeaponType    | Weapon classification (e.g., Swords, Axes, Rifles, Laser Guns)                |
| Material      | Primary material affecting durability and performance (e.g., Steel, Graphene) |
| Rarity        | Weapon rarity from "Common" (lowest) to "Mythical" (highest), (modified)      |
| AttackPower   | Numeric damage potential adjusted for dashboard comparisons                   |
| Durability    | Score reflecting weapon durability under use                                  |
| Range         | Effective range in meters (relevant for ranged weapons)                       |
| Weight        | Weight in kilograms affecting maneuverability                                 |

## Applications

- **Data Analysis:** Explore relationships between weapon type, material, and performance.  
- **Game Development:** Assist in balancing and designing engaging gameplay systems.  
- **Machine Learning:** Predict weapon effectiveness, simulate scenarios, or classify items.

